.TH ag-auth-status 1  "status 0.3.0-beta.5"
.SH NAME
ag\-auth\-status \- List saved connections; \-\-check asks each server whether its saved credential still works
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag auth status\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fISERVER\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List saved connections; \-\-check asks each server whether its saved credential still works
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Verify saved credentials online. Without this, status is local and works offline
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<TIMEOUT>\fR [default: 5]
Timeout for each online check, in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\-file\fR \fI<CA_FILE>\fR
Extra CA certificate (PEM) for online checks
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fISERVER\fR]
Inspect just this server (a repository URL works too)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.5
